<title>UK: BOC EDGES HIGHER AS RESULTS MEET FORECASTS.</title>
<headline>BOC EDGES HIGHER AS RESULTS MEET FORECASTS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in British specialist gases company BOC Group rose at the open on Tuesday after the company announced third quarter profit figures within expectations.</p>
<p>The shares were up 6p at 11.76 stg.</p>
</text>
